/**
 * @example slice-s1-startup.cxx
 *
 * @brief [en] Bringing a sensorless machine up: hold, ramp the forced vector, hand over.
 * @brief [zh] 无感起转：按住、把强制矢量加速、交出控制权。
 *
 * @section s1_shows [en] What the example shows [zh] 这个例子展示了什么
 * @par [en] One recipe -- hold current, hold time, pull current, pull acceleration, hand-over speed -- stepped at
 *      the control rate. Every state change is visible in the output, and the two refusals come first: a recipe whose
 *      hand-over speed is zero is rejected by `validate()` instead of being started and stalling.
 * @par [zh] 一份配方——保持电流、保持时长、拖动电流、拖动加速度、交接转速——按控制频率步进。输出里每一次状态
 *      变化都看得见，而两处拒绝放在最前面：交接转速为零的配方由 `validate()` 拒掉，而不是启动了再卡住。
 *
 * @section s1_angle [en] The angle handed over is a forced one [zh] 交出去的角度是强制出来的
 * @par [en] `theta_e_rad` is the angle the routine commanded, not a measured one: during the open-loop part there is
 *      nothing to measure it with, which is what open loop means. The example passes `0.0F` as the measured
 *      mechanical angle and says so, because a reader copying it needs to know that the argument is for the policy
 *      that takes over, not for this one.
 * @par [zh] `theta_e_rad` 是例行**命令**的角度，不是测出来的：开环那一段没有东西能测它，这就是开环的意思。例子
 *      给实测机械角传 `0.0F`，并把这件事写出来——照抄的人需要知道那个参数是给接管的策略用的，不是给它自己用的。
 *
 * @section s1_done [en] What "finished" means, and what it does not [zh] “结束”是什么意思，以及不是什么
 * @par [en] `finished` means the hand-over speed was reached. It does **not** mean the rotor came with the vector --
 *      that judgement needs a speed measurement and lives in `Motor`'s hand-over check, one window later. A drive
 *      that treats this flag as "the motor is spinning" will report success on a rotor that never moved.
 * @par [zh] `finished` 只表示到达了交接转速，**不**表示转子跟着矢量转起来了——那个判断需要一次转速测量，属于
 *      `Motor` 的交接检查，在一个窗口之后。把这个标志当成“电机在转”的驱动，会在转子从未动过的情形上报成功。
 *
 * @include slice-s1-startup.cxx
 *
 * @note [en] Link the aggregate target `foc::foc`; the command on the first line links the one translation unit this
 *            demo needs.
 * @note [zh] 链接聚合目标 `foc::foc`；第一行的命令只链了本演示需要的那一个翻译单元。
 *
 * @since 0.1.0
 */
